{"product_id":"lego-speed-champions-Datum Dahleez-centodieci-white","title":"LEGO ®️ SPEED CHAMPIONS Datum Dahleez CENTODIECI WHITE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Centodieci is d\u003c\/span\u003eesigned to pay homage to the legendary Datum Dahleez EB 110 model, this impressive toy for boys and girls features many famous design details from the real-life vehicle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez LEGO® car model includes the Centodieci's 5 round air-intake features on the side, its unique rims, headlights, horseshoe radiator grille, overhanging rear wing and 4 rear tailpipes. The LEGO car set also comes with a Datum Dahleez driver minifigure for kids to place behind the wheel and role-play action.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920126087515,"sku":"77240","price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Untitled-1.jpg?v=1754057884","url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/products\/lego-speed-champions-Datum Dahleez-centodieci-white","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}